{"id": "EUVD-2026-76639", "enisaUuid": "51eafde4-300d-398f-af37-8d6d3566e498", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nKVM: arm64: GICv2: Don't WARN on out-of-range GICV_DIR INTID\n\nvgic_v2_deactivate() passes the INTID a guest wrote to GICV_DIR straight\nto vgic_get_vcpu_irq(), and treats a failed lookup as a \"can't happen\"\ncondition with WARN_ON_ONCE().\n\nThe guest can make it happen at will, though: for any INTID outside of\nthe implemented SGI, PPI and SPI ranges the lookup returns NULL, since\nGICv2 has no LPIs. A guest running with EOImode==1 writing such an INTID\nto GICV_DIR triggers the WARN, and panics hosts running with\npanic_on_warn.\n\nDrop the WARN and ignore failed lookups.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:46:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:51:40", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/78b95c571d021391153a5ac7981e9e4d5cc856a3", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c6d9c8ac6521d3049ec90ac58bebd23ed03ac496"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89727", "GHSA-v32g-7j7h-69wx"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "43c45b30-13b7-3f4b-8987-aec3bcd19a3a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "781f2930-964c-37d7-952b-29b96d35617e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "255de897e7fb918a34845167c572b5bf8e1d9d79 <78b95c571d021391153a5ac7981e9e4d5cc856a3"}, {"id": "8def4d4f-d70f-347d-91d9-f416f6007887", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "8f0862a4-089e-3d18-a59e-d34e54a0d853", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.19"}, {"id": "999e67dd-48bb-3838-ac17-31e803b4591d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "255de897e7fb918a34845167c572b5bf8e1d9d79 <c6d9c8ac6521d3049ec90ac58bebd23ed03ac496"}, {"id": "b59b249d-9e69-36ef-a520-4c19497baddc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c3dde0d4-b9ff-3152-93e6-37b183648524", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}